            "rationale": "Bounded independent machine source judgement. Actual contents require planning and carrying out electrophoresis using dyes as a model; amino-acid conduct is only ggf. The complete new cell accurately preserves this distinction. Current373 requires a self-planned actual dye model with reference/conditions, own raw data and model-transfer limits; an amino-acid plan is a companion required by19ac. No actual amino-acid experiment, second universal real run or GA duty is required. Actual approved dye-model practical performance directly carries content3; its transfer limit prevents equating dye migration with an observed amino-acid run. No whole source/course or human approval.",
