            "rationale": "AUTHOR-only current source8 successor. Actual MV physical32/printed28 places the disposal-environmental-problem, rare-metal-extraction and recycling paragraph in Hinweise und Anregungen beside secondary electrochemical sources, with the explicit operator sind zu diskutieren. Physical5/printed1 explains that this right column includes both implementation suggestions and guidance on necessary/sufficient depth; it is not a blanket optionality flag. Keep the original column/status and this discussion requirement: do not relabel it as left-column Verbindliche Inhalte, and do not downgrade it to an arbitrary optional activity. Keep common GK/LK source occurrences and the original rare-metals qualifier, not a rare-earth synonym. The narrow f54/f9 contributions and retained c884 component remain partial; no unbounded whole-source/course approval or actual industrial recycling performance is claimed. Existing source-cell component limits remain; no full-source/course or D/P/A/M/V approval is asserted.",
